{"parse": {"title": "柯恩宝贝", "pageid": 2222, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"柯恩宝贝\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/21/Item-190007.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"柯恩宝贝\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>柯恩宝贝</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#190007</div></div><hr /><div>象征丰收的收获祭司。能为荒原枢纽的各部分带来提升。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">有人把柯恩宝贝认作邪恶的巫术道具，认为她的丰收是掠夺而来的。并不是，并不是。在一无所有的荒原上，丰收只会来自幸运的馈赠。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">资源·丰收时令</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "柯恩宝贝"}}